# Entries that must NEVER be promoted to the AgenticOS template by scripts/sync-memory.sh.
#
# One substring per line; any memory entry containing it is skipped. Blank lines and
# lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Use this for knowledge that is real and durable but scoped to THIS repo. The template is
# inherited by every repo you later create from it, so repo-specific traps there are
# noise that costs every future session tokens to read past.
#
# Without this file the sync would re-add anything deleted upstream on the very next run,
# because it decides what to send by diffing against the template.
#
# Ships empty on purpose: what counts as too-specific depends on the repo. An example of
# the kind of entry that belongs here:
#   <vendor> changed their dashboard layout
